<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DTE Energy lowered. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DTE Energy lowered. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it lowered the rating on DTE Energy Co to market underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>(Goldman corrects ratings change in headline and story).</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
